WEBVTT

00:00:00.354 --> 00:00:05.460
Signing in and signing up — One sign-in for WorkDesk, Taskana, the Handbook and the Knowledge Base.

00:00:06.666 --> 00:00:11.274
This is the Employee Portal's sign-in page — one sign-in for every GALIL app.

00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:16.761
With a company Microsoft account, use Sign in with Microsoft. Microsoft Authenticator confirms it's you.

00:00:17.408 --> 00:00:23.014
Or use your company email and password. Forgot password sends you a link to set a new one.

00:00:23.858 --> 00:00:27.462
The language switch works here already — English or Hebrew.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:31.736
New at GALIL? Create an account takes four short steps.

00:00:34.183 --> 00:00:40.035
Step 1 — who you are: your name, company email, a password (or link Microsoft instead), and your mobile.

00:00:55.308 --> 00:01:01.314
Step 2 — the role you ask for. Employee is the default; anything above Team Lead needs an administrator's approval.

00:01:04.247 --> 00:01:08.600
Step 3 — your profile: job title, department, team, manager and working hours.

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:20.719
Step 4 — check everything, accept the usage policy, and create the account.

00:01:24.937 --> 00:01:32.265
The account now waits for activation: the CEO or an Operations Manager confirms the role, sets the team and projects — and you get an email.

00:01:35.146 --> 00:01:38.753
Once you're active, sign in with your email and password.

00:01:47.485 --> 00:01:53.987
And you're on the portal's home page. You stay signed in on this device until you sign out, or after 12 hours away.

00:01:54.702 --> 00:01:58.833
One sign-in, every app — More help: the Handbook → Signing in and signing up.
